@ 1:5  ishi|kawa-beta
  1:1-1:14 "ishikawa-beta"
  | **`ishikawa-beta`**
  |
  | `ishikawa-beta` or `ishikawa`: starts an Ishikawa (fishbone) diagram. Its first line is the effect, at the head of the fish; the indented lines after it are the causes, as bones off the spine.
